-- Thirty more made-up sample businesses for the Templates gallery, one or more for every design, including
-- the five new ones (stay, menu, celebrate, listing, clinic). Like the others, they are fictional, never appear
-- in dashboards, and their forms save nothing. Photos are looked up from Wikimedia Commons by hero_query and
-- image_query when the app starts.

